{"1842040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soul Split", "steam_appid": 1842040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/12225ae24c4fd2b8e59336a35e848b00.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/12225ae24c4fd2b8e59336a35e848b00.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by a one-sided contract, you’ve been brought back from the afterlife to deal with a terrible curse that has befallen the land. Blast your way through an ancient dungeon, befriend its few talkative inhabitants, and grow your arcane prowess to unimaginable heights in order to deal with the threat and uphold your end of the deal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/5e82e805f8b973a401adee03a79db563.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/5e82e805f8b973a401adee03a79db563.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of spells spread across seven elements and dozens of sub-elements. Each spell may be taken to a Spell Forge and be twisted into one of three superior versions. Infuse your lightning with blood, turn your earth spells molten or make your ice spells crystalline. Each element has a unique cross-over with one another, and several enhancements of their own making for an absurd amount of variety when build-crafting throughout a run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/7f939d06813ce2410903b6acf9764457.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/7f939d06813ce2410903b6acf9764457.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the world’s depths through lost lands that were once said to be swallowed by the earth itself. From the quiet halls of the Exilis Archives, to the violent swamps of the Khorsian Lowlands, learn about the history of the world both contemporary and ancient to piece together what exactly lead to the current state of affairs, and how it can be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/8ff21e2489daa717781a437b7315b0bb.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/8ff21e2489daa717781a437b7315b0bb.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Combat</strong> <strong>-</strong> Fight the terrors of the world with relentless and chaotic spell-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ocean of Spells - </strong>Hundreds of spells to unlock from regular progression and through discovering secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Magicks -</strong> Harness the power of the Spell Forge to twist your spells in countless directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Madness -</strong> Create countless builds with spells spanning 7 elements and over 40 subtypes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World to Discover -</strong> Explore a world that's falling apart at the seams from a cataclysmic curse. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everchanging Dungeons -</strong> Encounter World Events in your delves that may drastically change the region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fashion Split -</strong> Collect a swathe of armour to customize your sorcerer and make them your own. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/12225ae24c4fd2b8e59336a35e848b00.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/12225ae24c4fd2b8e59336a35e848b00.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by a one-sided contract, you’ve been brought back from the afterlife to deal with a terrible curse that has befallen the land. Blast your way through an ancient dungeon, befriend its few talkative inhabitants, and grow your arcane prowess to unimaginable heights in order to deal with the threat and uphold your end of the deal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/217ac6b4b9bf5b5f765b5f476f2caed4.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/5e82e805f8b973a401adee03a79db563.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/5e82e805f8b973a401adee03a79db563.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hundreds of spells spread across seven elements and dozens of sub-elements. Each spell may be taken to a Spell Forge and be twisted into one of three superior versions. Infuse your lightning with blood, turn your earth spells molten or make your ice spells crystalline. Each element has a unique cross-over with one another, and several enhancements of their own making for an absurd amount of variety when build-crafting throughout a run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/9e3b231abc981b6c584def5f2b269ea2.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/7f939d06813ce2410903b6acf9764457.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/7f939d06813ce2410903b6acf9764457.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into the world’s depths through lost lands that were once said to be swallowed by the earth itself. From the quiet halls of the Exilis Archives, to the violent swamps of the Khorsian Lowlands, learn about the history of the world both contemporary and ancient to piece together what exactly lead to the current state of affairs, and how it can be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.poster.avif?t=1788168754\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.webm?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/350f726e6a31f3cc5118ea3f02bf827a.mp4?t=1788168754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras/8ff21e2489daa717781a437b7315b0bb.avif?t=1788168754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/extras_big/8ff21e2489daa717781a437b7315b0bb.webp?t=1788168754 width=1560 height=237 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive Combat</strong> <strong>-</strong> Fight the terrors of the world with relentless and chaotic spell-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Ocean of Spells - </strong>Hundreds of spells to unlock from regular progression and through discovering secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Magicks -</strong> Harness the power of the Spell Forge to twist your spells in countless directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elemental Madness -</strong> Create countless builds with spells spanning 7 elements and over 40 subtypes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World to Discover -</strong> Explore a world that's falling apart at the seams from a cataclysmic curse. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everchanging Dungeons -</strong> Encounter World Events in your delves that may drastically change the region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fashion Split -</strong> Collect a swathe of armour to customize your sorcerer and make them your own. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Soul Split is a magical action-roguelite set within a cursed dungeon sequestered near the edge of the world. Uncover secrets, befriend strange creatures, and harness the power of a sandbox hundreds of spells strong to burn your path to the dungeon's heart.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/a8e5afa83160da72762ba31ba5ce9c0732f354f9/header.jpg?t=1788168754", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/46fa7fa32641c0bc54f8eff2bcc0bb166cf1de24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788168754", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842040/46fa7fa32641c0bc54f8eff2bcc0bb166cf1de24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788168754", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</s